     <P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>25</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>日，我校党委领导班子集中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">天时间，深入开展“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育第一次专题学习，具体包括集体读原著学习、交流研讨学习和主题参观学习三部分内容。市教育局党委“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育第一巡回指导组副组长钱金星、联络员解明远也莅临参加。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616244834.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>上午</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>8:30</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">起，校党委班子全体成员在党委书记、校长王琛的带领下，集中到行政楼三楼会议室三静心读原著、学原文、悟原理，带着问题、带着思考深入学习《习近平关于“不忘初心、牢记使命”重要论述选编》等理论书籍。此外，班子成员还认真摘抄、领读了《习近平在“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育工作会议上的讲话》、《习近平主持十九届中共中央政治局第十五次集体学习并发表重要讲话》、《习近平出席中央和国家机关党的建设工作会议并发表重要讲话》、《始终牢记党的初心和使命——记习近平总书记在内蒙古考察并指导开展“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育》、《习近平出席全国教育大会并发表重要讲话》等重点篇目。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616250732.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">下午，班子成员在上午学习领悟的基础上进行了研讨交流。大家围绕党的政治建设、全面从严治党、理想信念、宗旨性质、担当作为、政治纪律和政治规矩、党性修养、廉洁自律等八个方面开展研讨，交流读原著、学原文、悟原理的体会和领悟，剖析思想根源、阐述思想认识、交流学习体会。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p> </P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616252224.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR><BR></P></o:p></SPAN>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>交流会上，王琛结合自身学习体会，作了“全面加强学校党的政治建设，全力推进学校高水平发展”的主题发言。他首先回顾了习近平总书记有关党的政治建设的重要论述内容，指出总书记有关党的政治建设的论述涵盖了党的政治建设的目的、意义和方法论，是我们主题教育学习贯彻的第一要义，对我校党的政治建设有着十分重要的指导意义。他强调，学校党的政治建设直接关系到学校的办学方向、办学质量和办学水平，要进一步加强学校党的政治建设，强化全体党员教师的责任担当，锻造德行好、动力足、肯干事、能力强的师资队伍。他要求，学校党委班子和全体教职员工要高举习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想伟大旗帜，贯彻落实全国、全省、全市教育大会精神，坚持立德树人，坚持素质教育，坚持深化教育教学改革，根据《绍兴一中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2017-2020</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>三年发展规划》，以“五星育人、三名争创”为总抓手，以学校凝聚力建设为重点，以“学为中心”机制体制创新为突破口，以“五育并举”培育新时代人才为落脚点，努力实现教育教学核心指标全市领先和家长满意率进市直学校前三两大目标，做好全国文明校园和省现代化创建准备工作，落实好五个方面</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>25</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">项具体工作，下好绍兴一中高水平发展先手棋，全力开创学校高水平发展新局面。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616255545.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616255537.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR> </P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616255515.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616255555.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092616255536.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><BR><BR></P></o:p></SPAN>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">随后，党委班子其他成员一一作了交流发言。党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮，以“聚焦初心使命，强化担当作为”为题谈了自己的学习心得，指出“强化担当作为是检验主题教育实际成效的关键所在”，作为班子成员就要做到：坚定理想信念，努力在“想担当”上下功夫；强化担当意识，努力在“敢担当”上做文章；加强自我提升，努力在“能担当”上求突破。党委委员、副校长蒋明在发言中指出，作为班子成员要通过主题教育加强理论学习，提升理论水平；要加强党性锻炼，增强理想信念；要敢于迎难而上，彰显担当能力与品质；要优化脚踏实地、善作善成的工作作风。党委委员、副校长俞奇弘在发言中动情地说：“作为分管后勤的领导，为一中师生谋幸福，为一中发展谋保障，是我的初心和使命，也是激励自己辛勤付出的根本动力。”他从增强政治意识，始终保持清醒坚定；增强责任意识，认真履行党风廉政建设职责；增强宗旨意识，坚持廉洁从政；增强自律意识，积极主动接受监督等四方面谈了自己对分管工作的认识和体会。党委委员王月琴、朱水军也结合自身岗位职责谈了学习体会，表示要以本次主题教育为契机，进一步改进作风，做好工作，为学校的高水平发展贡献力量。</SPAN></FONT></P>
